"## Context\n\nF21, F22A, and F22B are approved. Maintained Jira guidance claims a DIG fallback although project selection must be explicit. The obsolete onboarding reference was retained only until the maintained onboarding flow shipped. Both pressure-test probes default to a deleted ticket executable, substitute DIG, and use ambient Python.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Require explicit project selection with no default or fallback project.\n- Delete scripts/jira-onboarding-reference after confirming no inbound references.\n- Make both manual probes use the checkout virtual environment by default while preserving supported overrides.\n- Require a separate mutation opt-in for each probe and complete a nonmutating preflight before ticket, reconciler, or Jira mutation.\n- Keep connected probes outside CI.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Jira setup guidance names no default or fallback project.\n- [ ] Neither probe substitutes DIG or another project when JIRA_PROJECT is absent.\n- [ ] Probe defaults use the checkout virtual environment, and REBAR_ENGINE_DIR plus REBAR_TICKET_CLI overrides still work.\n- [ ] Each probe requires documented mutation opt-in and fails before mutation when project, credentials, executable, import capability, or opt-in is absent.\n- [ ] No repository reference remains to scripts/jira-onboarding-reference.\n- [ ] No CI workflow invokes the connected probes.\n- [ ] Focused preflight tests, bash syntax checks, shellcheck, lint, and type checking pass.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Run `pytest tests/scripts/test_jira_pressure_test_preflight.py`.\n- Run `bash -n scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_validation_probe.sh scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_field_validation_probe.sh`.\n- Run `shellcheck scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_validation_probe.sh scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_field_validation_probe.sh`.\n- Run `make lint` and `make typecheck` with the checkout virtual environment first on PATH.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/jira-sync-setup.md","reason":"Require explicit Jira project selection with no fallback project."},{"path":"scripts/jira-onboarding-reference/README.md","reason":"Delete the obsolete onboarding reference."},{"path":"scripts/jira-onboarding-reference/jira-credential-helper.sh","reason":"Delete the obsolete onboarding helper."},{"path":"scripts/jira-onboarding-reference/test-jira-credential-helper.sh","reason":"Delete the obsolete onboarding helper test."},{"path":"scripts/jira-pressure-test/README.md","reason":"Document explicit project selection, virtual environment use, mutation opt-in, and preflight."},{"path":"scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_validation_probe.sh","reason":"Repair executable selection and add guarded preflight."},{"path":"scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_field_validation_probe.sh","reason":"Repair executable selection and add guarded preflight."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_jira_pressure_test_preflight.py","reason":"Prove both probes refuse mutation before required preconditions pass."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2bce-d81d-0eed-42e5"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2bce-d81d-0eed-42e5","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["documentation","jira","F21","F22"],"ticket_id":"c92d-2b20-273c-4f78","ticket_type":"story","title":"Require explicit Jira project selection and repair reference probes","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["0a065656-e06b-4afd-9209-9fd236a107a8","f41c46d9-9d92-47d4-a5cb-0ca420efc867","de6a632a-abb5-4af5-b5c8-0565e0027b36","8b342e63-1f73-4046-a09b-cca8ec0aa7cc"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787595005651905506,"uuid":"35c786d2-51ce-468b-a42c-b18f22878aed"}